hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"138","A'udhu billahi min ash-shaytan ir-rajim, wa 'atful 'ala yasarik (thalathan). I seek refuge in Allah from the accursed Satan, and blow on your left side (three times)"
"139","Allahumma la sahla illa ma ja'altahu sahlan, wa anta taj'alul-hazna idha shi'ta sahlan.. O Allah, there is no ease except in that which You have made easy, and You can make sorrow easy if You will."
